{"seq":1,"slug":"software-technology","title":"软件技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology","introMarkdown":"# 软件技术 简介\n\n软件技术专业（专业代码 510203）是高等职业教育中面向信息技术产业的核心专业，学制三年，面向高中及中职毕业生招生。本专业以培养具备扎实编程能力、工程素养和持续学习能力的应用型软件人才为目标，毕业生可胜任 Java 开发工程师、Web 前端开发工程师、软件测试工程师、运维工程师等岗位。\n\n2026 年的软件行业正经历 AI 辅助编程、云原生架构和鸿蒙生态崛起三大趋势的深刻变革。GitHub Copilot、Cursor 等 AI 编程工具已成为开发者日常生产力的重要组成部分；全栈开发能力从\"加分项\"变为\"必备项\"；华为鸿蒙 HarmonyOS NEXT 带来了全新的 ArkTS 开发范式。本专业课程体系紧跟产业需求，将这些前沿技术融入教学实践。\n\n本专业教学内容划分为四大模块：\n\n**第一章 编程基础** 覆盖 Java 程序设计、数据结构与算法、数据库应用开发三个方向，帮助学生建立从语言语法到数据存储的完整技术栈底层能力。\n\n**第二章 Web 全栈开发** 从前端 Vue3 组件化开发到后端 Spring Boot API 构建，再到鸿蒙 ArkTS 与跨平台移动应用，打通客户端到服务端的全链路开发能力。\n\n**第三章 软件工程实践** 聚焦软件测试方法论与自动化、Git 协作工作流、敏捷项目管理，培养学生在团队环境中交付高质量软件的工程素养。\n\n**第四章 云原生与运维** 涵盖 Linux 系统管理、Docker/Kubernetes 容器编排以及 AI 辅助开发工具实践，对接当前企业级部署与智能开发的真实场景。\n\n推荐学习路径为按章节顺序推进：先夯实编程基础，再拓展全栈能力，然后在工程实践中提升协作水平，最后掌握云原生部署与 AI 工具应用。每个模块都包含动手练习和项目实战，鼓励学生通过\"做中学\"的方式将理论转化为可交付的技术成果。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-fundamentals","title":"编程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/programming-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"java-programming","title":"Java 程序设计","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/programming-fundamentals/java-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-structures-algorithms","title":"数据结构与算法","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/programming-fundamentals/data-structures-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"database-application","title":"数据库应用开发","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/programming-fundamentals/database-application"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"web-fullstack","title":"Web 全栈开发","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"frontend-development","title":"前端开发","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack/frontend-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"backend-api-development","title":"后端 API 开发","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack/backend-api-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mobile-app-development","title":"移动应用开发","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack/mobile-app-development"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"software-engineering","title":"软件工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/software-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"software-testing","title":"软件测试","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/software-engineering/software-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"version-control-collaboration","title":"版本控制与协作","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/software-engineering/version-control-collaboration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"agile-project-management","title":"敏捷项目管理","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/software-engineering/agile-project-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"cloud-devops","title":"云原生与运维","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linux-administration","title":"Linux 运维","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/linux-administration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"container-orchestration","title":"容器与编排","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/container-orchestration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-assisted-development","title":"AI 辅助开发","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/ai-assisted-development"}]}]}